## 7. Voice Settings (User Control)

Stored locally in Hive:

Box:
`notification_settings`

Key:
`voiceEnabled`

Users can enable/disable:
- Voice reminder playback
- Spoken notifications

IMPORTANT:
- Voice preference must be checked before speaking.
- Do NOT bypass user preference.

---

## 8. Voice Summary Logic

Dynamic summaries are generated using:

- Active medication filtering
- Date comparison
- Stock threshold detection
- Firestore data streams

Example logic:
- Only active medications
- Exclude completed today
- Add low stock warnings

This ensures summaries are context-aware and safe.

---

## 9. Accessibility & Compliance Considerations

The voice system:

- Does NOT give medical advice
- Only reads stored data
- Respects user privacy settings
- Stops immediately when navigating
- Does not autoplay without user action (except controlled summaries)

---

## 10. What Must NOT Be Changed

- TTSService structure
- Singleton pattern usage
- stopIfSpeaking() calls
- Voice toggle Hive key names
- Screen-level dispose stop logic

Changing these may cause:
- Overlapping audio
- Background playback
- Accessibility inconsistencies
- Broken navigation behavior

